	(text "OC_SENSE must stay within\n-0.3V to 5.3V, or else\ncomparator in OC detection\nwill be damaged. Shottkey\nprotects this. (5.3V not possible,\nsince that would imply 53A and the\nwhole board would have exploded long\nbefore then)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 114.3 84.074 0)
		(effects
